# Keep every text file LF in the repository *and* in the working tree.
#
# Without this, a Windows checkout (core.autocrlf=true, which GitHub Actions
# runners use) materialises CRLF, and `gofmt -l` then reports every single Go
# file as "needs formatting" because gofmt always writes LF. That made the
# Windows CI job fail with a list of files nobody had touched.
#
# Binary formats are excluded so they are never line-ending converted.
* text=auto eol=lf

*.png binary
*.jpg binary
*.jpeg binary
*.gif binary
*.ico binary
*.apk binary
*.exe binary
*.zip binary
*.jar binary
# Windows scripts keep CRLF: cmd.exe is unreliable with LF-only .bat files.
*.bat text eol=crlf
*.cmd text eol=crlf
*.ps1 text eol=crlf

*.woff binary
*.woff2 binary
*.ttf binary
